    "steps": [
      "Brown the ground beef in a large pot over medium-high heat on COOK-01. Drain excess fat.",
      "Add diced onion and cook 5 minutes until softened. Add garlic and cook 1 minute more.",
      "Stir in chili powder and cumin, cook 30 seconds.",
      "Add diced tomatoes, tomato sauce, and black beans. Stir to combine.",
      "Bring to a boil, then reduce heat and simmer uncovered 60-75 minutes at 9,000 ft, stirring occasionally.",
      "Taste and adjust seasoning. Serve."
